  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f22f57d0cf5c493280a0ab6b7dbaea9e3fc5b035c6d410d59c2f476043bd03a8.png] \n\nGiven expression : [{(44 # 38) # (2 # 5)} # (4 # 2)] # 5 # 10\n\nOption 1) ×, ÷, ×, ×, –, +, = \n\n[{(__**44 × **____**38**__) ÷ (__**2**____** **____**× 5**__)} × (__**4 – 2**__)] + 5 = 10\n\n[{__**1672 ÷ 10**__} × 8] + 5 = 10\n\n[__167.2____** × 8**__] + 5 = 10\n\n**__1337.6 __**+ 5 = 10\n\n1342.6 ≠ 10\n\nOption 2) ×, –, +, ×, ÷, ×, = \n\n[{(__**44 × 38**__) - (__**2 + 5**__)} × (__**4 ÷ 2**__)] × 5 = 10\n\n[{__**1672 - 7**__} × (8)] × 5 = 10\n\n[__**1665 × (**____**8**____**)**__] × 5 = 10\n\n__**13320 ×**____** 5**__ = 10\n\n66600 ≠ 10\n\nOption 3) –, +, ×, ×, ÷, ×, = \n\n[{(__**44 - **____**38**__) + (__**2**____** **____**× 5**__)} × (__**4 ÷ 2**__)] × 5 = 10\n\n[{__**(6) + (10)**__} × (2)] × 5 = 10\n\n[__**16 × (2**____**)**__] × 5 = 10\n\n__**32 **____**× 5**__ = 10\n\n160 ≠ 10\n\nOption 4) –, +, ×, ÷, ×, ×, =\n\n[{(__**44 - **____**38**__) + (__**2**____** **____**× 5**__)} ÷ (__**4 × 2**__)] × 5 = 10\n\n[{__(6) + (10)__} ÷ (8)] × 5 = 10\n\n__**[16 ÷ (8**____**)**__] × 5 = 10\n\n**__2 × 5__** = 10\n\n**10 = 10**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 4.**",
